{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00677","headline":"郊庙歌辞  懿宗室舞 · 萧仿","name":"郊庙歌辞  懿宗室舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣祚无疆，庆传乐章。\n金枝繁茂，玉叶延长。\n海渎常[晏]，波涛不扬。\n汪汪美化，垂范今王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧仿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00677.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00677","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}